  "post_content": "<p><img alt=\"\" src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/2014/07/IMG_2605.jpg\" style=\"width: 480px; height: 320px;\" /></p>\n<p>El grupo scout Virgen del Carmen de Tales ha partido poco despu&eacute;s de las 10 de la ma&ntilde;ana de este jueves hacia el monasterio de la Virgen del Olivar, en Estercuel (Teruel), donde permanecer&aacute;n hasta el 31 de julio.</p>\n<p></p>\n<div class=\"galeria-ngg\" style=\"display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:8px;\"><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/scoutsvergecarmetalescampament/img_2601.jpg\" alt=\"img_2601\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/scoutsvergecarmetalescampament/img_2605.jpg\" alt=\"img_2605\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/scoutsvergecarmetalescampament/img_2609.jpg\" alt=\"img_2609\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/scoutsvergecarmetalescampament/img_2610.jpg\" alt=\"img_2610\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/scoutsvergecarmetalescampament/img_2611.jpg\" alt=\"img_2611\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/scoutsvergecarmetalescampament/img_2612.jpg\" alt=\"img_2612\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/scoutsvergecarmetalescampament/img_2613.jpg\" alt=\"img_2613\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /><img src=\"https://pub-912f25dfbd4d4e8a976d0d4715439efb.r2.dev/scoutsvergecarmetalescampament/img_2614.jpg\" alt=\"img_2614\" style=\"max-width:100%;height:auto;\" /></div>"
